## Code Example

```javascript
function interleave64to128(a,b){
  // spreading, combining, returning {hi, lo}
  // exact spread64to128 implementation omitted for brevity
  const spreadA = spread64to128(a);
  const spreadB = spread64to128(b);
  const hi = spreadA.hi | (spreadB.hi << 1n);
  const lo = spreadA.lo | (spreadB.lo << 1n);
